1
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,020
I am Kamea of House Arano,

2
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:15,700
High Lady of the Aurigan Reach,

3
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,980
Protector of Coromodir,

4
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:20,540
and the Sword of Restoration.

5
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:26,050
But I am not a hero… no matter what the stories say.

6
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:32,020
A hero would have sacrificed more, compromised less.

7
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,560
A hero would have done better.

8
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:42,540
You know this, of course - you were there.

9
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:50,420
My father used to tell me stories about the ancient times,

10
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,140
about the Star League.

11
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:55,820
A golden age of prosperity,

12
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:59,020
upheld by the great MechWarriors of old -

13
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:01,020
guardians of the innocent,

14
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:03,020
protectors of the peace.

15
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:06,420
I always dreamed of following in their footsteps!

16
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:12,020
I was too young to see the truth of things.

17
00:01:12,780 --> 00:01:16,620
After all, it wasn't heroism

18
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:19,780
or a noble cause that won me the throne.

19
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:23,620
It was hiring a mercenary skilled enough -

20
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:25,900
perhaps ruthless enough -

21
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:27,820
to carry the day.

22
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:30,020
Hiring <b>you</b>.

23
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:33,420
I still don't know if you fought for honor,

24
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:34,820
or for the thrill of it.

25
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:36,620
For belief in my cause,

26
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,980
or just in my money.

27
00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:43,460
But whether it was your noble heart or mercenary mind…

28
00:01:43,780 --> 00:01:47,020
your actions gave us hope.

29
00:01:47,180 --> 00:01:50,020
That makes you a hero in the eyes of history.

30
00:01:50,780 --> 00:01:52,420
Whether you believe it?

31
00:01:56,980 --> 00:01:58,420
That's up to you.

